  "handle": "personalized-colorful-class-teacher-welcome-door-mat-classroom-decor",
  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a unique way to welcome students and guests to any classroom. Featuring a Composition Notebook design, this doormat combines functionality with a special touch, making it an ideal addition to a teacher's space. It is designed for everyday use, effectively trapping dirt and moisture to help keep floors clean.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher’s name for a unique classroom entrance.</li>\n<li>Serves as a thoughtful and unique gift for educators.</li>\n<li>Features a soft, heat-resistant top and a non-slip backing for durability.</li>\n<li>Efficiently dries wet feet and traps dirt and grime.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor classroom environments.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy, Neoprene Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Washable and easy to clean. Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap. Avoid bleaching and air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is perfect for classroom entrances, teacher spaces, and reading corners, creating a welcoming and personalized environment. It is also suitable for entryways and RVs, offering a practical and decorative accent.</p>",
